ta-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 19 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 19 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 19 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Reproducible work অন্য person বা future self-কে data বুঝতে, step repeat করতে এবং same result পেতে সাহায্য করে। Practical documentation ও versioning habit শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Reproducible work allows another person—or your future self—to understand the data, repeat the steps, and obtain the same result. Learn practical documentation and versioning habits.\">Reproducible work allows another person—or your future self—to understand the data, repeat the steps, and obtain the same result. Learn practical documentation and versioning habits.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Reproducibility ও traceability explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain reproducibility and traceability.\">Explain reproducibility and traceability.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Minimum analysis record তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create a minimum analysis record.\">Create a minimum analysis record.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Raw, processed ও output data আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate raw, processed, and output data.\">Separate raw, processed, and output data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Assumption, transformation ও version document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document assumptions, transformations, and versions.\">Document assumptions, transformations, and versions.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Reproducible মানে কী\" data-en=\"What reproducible means\">What reproducible means</h2><p data-bn=\"Reproducible analysis-এ identifiable input, documented step, stable definition ও saved output থাকে যাতে result regenerate করা যায়। শুধু code নয়; Excel workbook, SQL script, Power BI model ও manual procedure-ও document করতে হয়।\" data-en=\"A reproducible analysis has identifiable inputs, documented steps, stable definitions, and saved outputs so the result can be regenerated. Reproducibility is not limited to code: Excel workbooks, SQL scripts, Power BI models, and manual procedures also need documentation.\">A reproducible analysis has identifiable inputs, documented steps, stable definitions, and saved outputs so the result can be regenerated. Reproducibility is not limited to code: Excel workbooks, SQL scripts, Power BI models, and manual procedures also need documentation.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data stage আলাদা করুন\" data-en=\"Separate data stages\">Separate data stages</h2><p data-bn=\"Raw source file unchanged ও read-only রাখুন। Cleaned/ transformed data separately। Report ও figure output হিসেবে। এতে result original evidence পর্যন্ত trace ও rule change হলে transformation rerun করা যায়।\" data-en=\"Keep raw source files unchanged and read-only. Store cleaned or transformed data separately. Store reports and figures as outputs. This separation makes it possible to trace a result back to original evidence and rerun transformations when rules change.\">Keep raw source files unchanged and read-only. Store cleaned or transformed data separately. Store reports and figures as outputs. This separation makes it possible to trace a result back to original evidence and rerun transformations when rules change.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Minimum documentation\" data-en=\"Minimum documentation\">Minimum documentation</h2><p data-bn=\"Question, owner, source, extraction date, field definition, row grain, exclusion, cleaning rule, formula/query, software version, validation check, output location ও limitation record করুন। README ও data dictionary অনেকটা cover করে।\" data-en=\"Record the question, owner, source, extraction date, field definitions, row grain, exclusions, cleaning rules, formulas or queries, software versions, validation checks, output location, and known limitations. A README and data dictionary can cover much of this.\">Record the question, owner, source, extraction date, field definitions, row grain, exclusions, cleaning rules, formulas or queries, software versions, validation checks, output location, and known limitations. A README and data dictionary can cover much of this.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Version ও change control\" data-en=\"Version and change control\">Version and change control</h2><p data-bn=\"Script ও documentation-এর জন্য meaningful filename বা version control ব্যবহার করুন। Record ছাড়া evidence overwrite করবেন না। Metric definition change হলে effective date ও historical value restated কি না note করুন।\" data-en=\"Use meaningful filenames or version control for scripts and documentation. Avoid overwriting evidence without a record. When a metric definition changes, note the effective date and whether historical values were restated.\">Use meaningful filenames or version control for scripts and documentation. Avoid overwriting evidence without a record. When a metric definition changes, note the effective date and whether historical values were restated.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Reproducibility\" data-en=\"Reproducibility\">Reproducibility</h3><p data-bn=\"Documented input ও step দিয়ে analysis repeat করার ability।\" data-en=\"Ability to repeat an analysis using documented inputs and steps.\">Ability to repeat an analysis using documented inputs and steps.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Lineage\" data-en=\"Lineage\">Lineage</h3><p data-bn=\"Source থেকে output পর্যন্ত data কীভাবে move ও change হয়েছে তার trace।\" data-en=\"Trace of how data moved and changed from source to output.\">Trace of how data moved and changed from source to output.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data dictionary\" data-en=\"Data dictionary\">Data dictionary</h3><p data-bn=\"Field-এর definition, type, unit, code ও rule।\" data-en=\"Definitions, types, units, codes, and rules for fields.\">Definitions, types, units, codes, and rules for fields.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Version control\" data-en=\"Version control\">Version control</h3><p data-bn=\"সময়ের সঙ্গে change record করার system বা practice।\" data-en=\"A system or practice for recording changes over time.\">A system or practice for recording changes over time.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Monthly expense analysis document\" data-en=\"Documenting a monthly expense analysis\">Documenting a monthly expense analysis</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Analyst তিনটি project-expense CSV combine করে budget utilization calculate করেন।\" data-en=\"An analyst combines three project-expense CSVs and calculates budget utilization.\">An analyst combines three project-expense CSVs and calculates budget utilization.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Original file raw/ folder-এ date ও প্রয়োজন হলে checksum-সহ save করুন।\" data-en=\"Save original files under raw/ with dates and checksums if appropriate.\">Save original files under raw/ with dates and checksums if appropriate.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Column definition ও currency document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document column definitions and currency.\">Document column definitions and currency.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Cleaning ও mapping rule store করুন।\" data-en=\"Store cleaning and mapping rules.\">Store cleaning and mapping rules.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Calculation formula ও denominator definition save করুন।\" data-en=\"Save the calculation formula and denominator definition.\">Save the calculation formula and denominator definition.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Software version, run date ও quality check record করুন।\" data-en=\"Record software version, run date, and quality checks.\">Record software version, run date, and quality checks.</p></li><li><span>6</span><p data-bn=\"Limitation ও source link-সহ output publish করুন।\" data-en=\"Publish output with limitations and source links.\">Publish output with limitations and source links.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Documentation isolated result-কে auditable analytical product-এ রূপ দেয়।\" data-en=\"Documentation turns an isolated result into an auditable analytical product.\">Documentation turns an isolated result into an auditable analytical product.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Raw evidence preserve করুন।\" data-en=\"Preserve raw evidence.\">Preserve raw evidence.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Input, step, definition ও version document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document inputs, steps, definitions, and versions.\">Document inputs, steps, definitions, and versions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Raw, processed ও output file আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate raw, processed, and output files.\">Separate raw, processed, and output files.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Lineage result auditable করে।\" data-en=\"Lineage makes results auditable.\">Lineage makes results auditable.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}